            "description": {
              "content": "Retrieves a list of built-in CVP micro-applications. Micro-applications are pre-built VXML applications for common IVR tasks such as playing media, collecting digits, and external VXML retrieval. These are invoked through ICM scripting via the Run External Script node.",
